# HW9 Reproducible Run Instructions

Run these commands from the `data260-4544/` project root.

## Install dependencies

```bash
python -m pip install -r code/requirements-hw08.txt
```

## Start Redis and Ollama

Start Redis with Homebrew:

```bash
brew services start redis
redis-cli ping
```

Expected output:

```text
PONG
```

Start Ollama in a separate terminal:

```bash
ollama serve
ollama pull qwen2.5:3b
```

## Run Part 1

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code python code/hw09_part1_counter.py
```

## Run Part 2

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code \
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0 \
SMOL_MODEL=qwen2.5:3b \
python code/hw09_part2_semantic_cache.py
```

## Run Part 3

Run the threshold sweep:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code \
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0 \
python code/hw09_part3_threshold_sweep.py
```

Run the false-hit demonstration:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code \
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0 \
python code/hw09_part3_false_hit.py
```

Run stale-answer invalidation:

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code \
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0 \
python code/hw09_part3_stale_invalidation.py
```

## Run Part 4

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code python code/hw09_part4.py
```

## Run the HW9 verification script

```bash
PYTHONPATH=code python code/verify-hw09.py
```

The verification script writes `reports/hw09/verification.json`.
